Anumaan
Fresh code written in September 2026 for Build with AI: Code for Communities, Second
Edition (Google Cloud x GDG India, Track 03). No code was reused from earlier projects.

All patient, dispensing, stock, bed, staff and warehouse data in this repository and in
the live demo is SYNTHETIC, generated by anumaan/sim.py and anumaan/care.py, and by
tools/registers.py for the register pages in tools/samples/ (their patient names and ages are
invented). The exceptions are anumaan/realcheck_england.json and
anumaan/realcheck_india.json (see "Real data" below). The Kerala replay's PHC locations are
real (see "Real locations" below); every record shown at them is synthetic.

